    "name": "Fiendish Quest",
    "steam_appid": 3689830,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To save his petrified mother, the protagonist embarks on a journey to find the legendary orbs said to grant any wish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This journey is not only one of rescue but also one that unravels the mystery behind his mother's petrification,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and why the people of this world are so cruel.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689830/extras/4ef3b7dcd37a5135a1ada46e2a17cb01.avif?t=1753322432\" width=612 height=161 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A half-demon, half-human girl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though she appears mature, she is still innocent and na\u00efve on the inside, with little awareness of the dangers around her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To save her mother\u2014who was turned to stone by a mysterious illness\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >she musters the courage to go against her grandfather's wishes and leaves the village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her deep love and determination for her mother become the driving force behind her growth and adventure.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689830/extras/d59cfff56d386c0aad75c693c0623d39.avif?t=1753322432\" width=383 height=103 /></span>A young swordsman who trains hard with one goal: to protect his childhood friend, Tarna.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though he cares deeply for her, his shyness causes him to act awkwardly, unable to express his feelings honestly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While he does not travel with her, his heart is always with her.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Orbs Scattered Across the World</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration and treasure hunting are the core of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player must find all seven orbs hidden around the world in order to have their wish granted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clues to their locations can be obtained by consulting the fortune teller at the Adventurer\u2019s Guild.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689830/extras/66ee3e3e420edefeaddbfa8edab64b73.poster.avif?t=1753322432\" width=612 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689830/extras/66ee3e3e420edefeaddbfa8edab64b73.webm?t=1753322432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689830/extras/66ee3e3e420edefeaddbfa8edab64b73.mp4?t=1753322432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some regions may be blocked by obstacles. In such cases,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you'll need to find specific &quot;key items&quot; to unlock the path and continue your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clues about the orbs' locations can be obtained from a fortune teller at the Adventurers' Guild,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >helping you take the next step in your quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689830/extras/ec1353274e8ebe3fc5fb4c442f8f6f9e.avif?t=1753322432\" width=612 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Find the Right Weapon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose weapons suited to the enemies you encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the right equipment, you'll be able to launch enemies away the moment they get close!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having the appropriate weapons makes infiltrating enemy bases much easier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689830/extras/b012fd3f95b487942d925985d7c9cff4.poster.avif?t=1753322432\" width=612 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689830/extras/b012fd3f95b487942d925985d7c9cff4.webm?t=1753322432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689830/extras/b012fd3f95b487942d925985d7c9cff4.mp4?t=1753322432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the other hand, entering without the correct weapons means you'll have to avoid all enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get hit too many times, and it's an instant GAME OVER.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689830/extras/d64ec37a5d3b19fd61b55c37268f57eb.poster.avif?t=1753322432\" width=612 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689830/extras/d64ec37a5d3b19fd61b55c37268f57eb.webm?t=1753322432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689830/extras/d64ec37a5d3b19fd61b55c37268f57eb.mp4?t=1753322432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To save his petrified mother, the protagonist embarks on a journey to find the legendary orbs said to grant any wish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This journey is not only one of rescue but also one that unravels the mystery behind his mother's petrification,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and why the people of this world are so cruel.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689830/extras/4ef3b7dcd37a5135a1ada46e2a17cb01.avif?t=1753322432\" width=612 height=161 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A half-demon, half-human girl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though she appears mature, she is still innocent and na\u00efve on the inside, with little awareness of the dangers around her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To save her mother\u2014who was turned to stone by a mysterious illness\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >she musters the courage to go against her grandfather's wishes and leaves the village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her deep love and determination for her mother become the driving force behind her growth and adventure.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689830/extras/d59cfff56d386c0aad75c693c0623d39.avif?t=1753322432\" width=383 height=103 /></span>A young swordsman who trains hard with one goal: to protect his childhood friend, Tarna.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though he cares deeply for her, his shyness causes him to act awkwardly, unable to express his feelings honestly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While he does not travel with her, his heart is always with her.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Orbs Scattered Across the World</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration and treasure hunting are the core of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player must find all seven orbs hidden around the world in order to have their wish granted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clues to their locations can be obtained by consulting the fortune teller at the Adventurer\u2019s Guild.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689830/extras/66ee3e3e420edefeaddbfa8edab64b73.poster.avif?t=1753322432\" width=612 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689830/extras/66ee3e3e420edefeaddbfa8edab64b73.webm?t=1753322432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689830/extras/66ee3e3e420edefeaddbfa8edab64b73.mp4?t=1753322432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some regions may be blocked by obstacles. In such cases,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you'll need to find specific &quot;key items&quot; to unlock the path and continue your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clues about the orbs' locations can be obtained from a fortune teller at the Adventurers' Guild,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >helping you take the next step in your quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689830/extras/ec1353274e8ebe3fc5fb4c442f8f6f9e.avif?t=1753322432\" width=612 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Find the Right Weapon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose weapons suited to the enemies you encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the right equipment, you'll be able to launch enemies away the moment they get close!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having the appropriate weapons makes infiltrating enemy bases much easier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689830/extras/b012fd3f95b487942d925985d7c9cff4.poster.avif?t=1753322432\" width=612 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689830/extras/b012fd3f95b487942d925985d7c9cff4.webm?t=1753322432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689830/extras/b012fd3f95b487942d925985d7c9cff4.mp4?t=1753322432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the other hand, entering without the correct weapons means you'll have to avoid all enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get hit too many times, and it's an instant GAME OVER.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689830/extras/d64ec37a5d3b19fd61b55c37268f57eb.poster.avif?t=1753322432\" width=612 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689830/extras/d64ec37a5d3b19fd61b55c37268f57eb.webm?t=1753322432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689830/extras/d64ec37a5d3b19fd61b55c37268f57eb.mp4?t=1753322432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
